window.bookSummaryJSON = "<b><b>An epic new LitRPG series from A.P. Beswick, social media superstar and the bestselling author of the Levanthria series, in which an ordinary man’s world is turned upside down when one day he’s a typical office drone, and the next he’s a stranger in a world full of magic and mayhem...</b></b><br><br><b>Skills required: Microsoft Excel, basic swordsmanship, and an ability to RAGE.</b><br> <br>In the blink of an eye, Silas’s world is turned upside down. One moment, he’s a data analyst navigating spreadsheets and avoiding office politics; the next, he’s thrust into an ancient realm of magic and mayhem, summoned by a desperate sorcerer seeking a champion to save their world. But Silas? He’s anything but a fighter. His battles are against deadlines, not dragons. Yet here he stands, chosen to be a guardian in a world that’s as beautiful as it is deadly.<br> <br>With the help of a mute child, who is as deadly as she is silent, they must navigate treacherous terrains while learning to master his new abilities.<br> <br>True power isn’t just about mastering your weapon, but also mastering yourself. With an ancient evil stirring and the fate of the realm in his unsteady hands, Silas must confront his fears, embrace his destiny, and discover the true meaning of being a guardian."; 
